# Use Cases

| # | Use case | Persona | Scenario | Question types | Sample docs | What it tests |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 01 | Due diligence financial review | PE / corp dev analyst reviewing a target | Verify financials, spot red flags, cross-check numbers between annual report, proxy, and Excel model | Numerical calc; cross-doc (10-K vs proxy); Excel step-by-step logic; reasoning on covenants/warning signs | <ul><li>Microsoft FY24 10-K + proxy</li><li>Volvo annual 2024</li><li>Maersk annual 2024</li><li>SVB last 10-Q</li><li>Synthesized Excel model deck with planted logic errors</li></ul> | Numeric extraction + cross-doc consistency + chained reasoning |
| 02 | ESG / sustainability audit | Sustainability lead prepping CSRD, or auditor | Extract every Scope 3 category, every material topic, every emissions figure; verify against CSRD/ESRS | Exhaustive search; numerical aggregation; multi-doc cross-reference (report vs framework) | <ul><li>Unilever sustainability report 2024</li><li>Ørsted sustainability report 2024</li><li>H&M sustainability report 2024</li><li>CSRD ESRS standards</li></ul> | Long-doc exhaustive extraction + framework alignment |
| 03 | Regulatory-vs-policy gap check | GRC / internal audit | Enumerate every obligation in a regulation; assess if internal policy addresses each yes/partial/no with citations on both sides | Cross-doc (reg vs policy); exhaustive requirements enumeration; classification; reasoning on partial coverage | <ul><li>EU AI Act consolidated</li><li>GDPR</li><li>NIS2 directive</li><li>Repo's <code>ops_security.docx</code></li><li>Repo's <code>secure_dev_policy.docx</code></li><li>Synthesized policy with planted gaps</li></ul> | Cross-doc reasoning + exhaustiveness + citation fidelity |
| 04 | Contract clause sweep | Legal ops / M&A counsel | Across a bundle of contracts, find every change-of-control, LoL, IP assignment, termination-for-convenience clause; classify each | Exhaustive (find every X); classification; clause-level citation fidelity | <ul><li>5–10 SEC EDGAR public material contracts</li><li>Synthesized MSA bundle with planted clauses</li></ul> | Exhaustive search across many docs + accurate clause-level citation |
| 05 | Board / committee composition audit | Corporate secretariat | Identify every board member + committee assignment; reconcile across proxy, governance HTML, scanned meeting minutes | Exhaustive person extraction; cross-doc identity resolution; mixed formats | <ul><li>3 cos' DEF 14A proxy statements</li><li>Frozen governance HTML</li><li>Board photo / org-chart PDF</li><li>Handwritten meeting-minutes scan</li></ul> | Exhaustive person extraction + identity reconciliation across formats |
| 06 | Multimodal evidence extraction | Advisory / forensic analyst | Pull facts from scanned old report, whiteboard photo, Excel with chart-as-image, handwritten notes | OCR-grade text from scans; handwriting recognition; image-only chart interpretation; cross-modal reconciliation | <ul><li>Scanned 1990s annual report</li><li>Whiteboard photo</li><li>Multi-tab Excel with chart-as-image</li><li>Original handwritten analyst notes</li></ul> | Format coverage — exposes tools that can't ingest non-text inputs |
